{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一輛九巴在長沙灣廣場巴士站，懷疑尾轆鬆脫，一名男童受輕傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發後巴士站金屬坐椅凹陷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在下午3時許，一輛開往美孚的86號線九巴，駛到長沙灣廣場對開巴士站時，左邊尾轆突然鬆脫，撞向巴士站欄杆。坐在欄杆後的7歲男童腳部受傷，清醒送往明愛醫院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-2330_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026XxUd5uwVGO1785861093.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-2330_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-2330_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Tl9jlKDXRk1785861105.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.CSW-2330_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">九巴指司機開車前曾檢查巴士，而今次情況罕見，會嚴肅跟進並約見生產商，及即時檢查所有配備相同部件設計的巴士，將於通宵完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T19:01:44.511819+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}